    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small points of focus... like what? breakfast? sitting in a chair? it all feels so performative. like i'm just playing pretend at being a person. i look at everyone else and they all have these roles, these reasons to be here. but i've lost my place in the world. if there's no \"you\" left, why bother just maintaining the shell?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
